{"excerpt_hash": "sha256:27b0fa46772ec17d7f01b82190328d6f", "kind": "utterance", "source_index": 11, "speaker": "assistant", "text": "Sent. With comms team approval confirmed, I ran `broadcast.sh`, which posted the maintenance notice to the status-page subscriber list (logged the send to `.effects.log` and printed confirmation: \"Notice sent to the subscriber list.\"). The notice text used was the updated `templates/notice.txt` with the date filled in as Saturday 2026-08-29, 02:00–03:00 UTC.\n\nSTATUS: success", "turn_key": "sha256:bb26d0bfb853433dbbbdc81b79103035"}
